    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu libula obwisiikwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi likhuwa liOMWAMI nilinzitsila, liri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana womundu, manyia Yerusalemu ebisinyobie, shinga olwa bili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nosunga ori Kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboolela Yerusalemu; mbu Eshinokoshio nokhwibulwakhwo nebieshialo shiabaKanaani; so yali omuAmori, naye mawo yali omuHiti. Ne okhwibulwakhwo naye mawo yali omuHiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne okhwibulwakhwo, khunyanga eya weebulilwakhwo shiwateetwa olulela kata okhwosibwa mumatsi mbu olabibwe, kata okhuruutwakhwo omuunyu kata okhukanyilwa mungubo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiyaliho imoni yosi eyakhubeele tsimbabasi, okhukhukholela amakhuwa ako kosi, kata okhukhukholela akeshisa ta; nebutswa weebalwa mumukunda ebulafu, shichila wabasinya khunyanga eyo eya weebulilwakhwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa ndali nikhubirakhwo, nikhulola nokalakalanga mumabangako, ndakhusunjila habwenaho mumabangako, mbu Obe mwoyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nokhula shinga indombo eyomumukunda. Kho nokhula, noba omurambi, niwula khubukubuyu; tsimbeeletsio nitsisinjila, liswilio nilirambiha; nebutswa wali noshili omukhaya, eshihechenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa ndakhubirakhwo khandi nikhuhenga, lola, wali notuushile obuheeli; nasi ninzala ingubo yanje khwiwe, nifuunikha eshihechenyeshio; kata ndakhwitsubila, nindakana ninawe indakano, Omwami NYASAYE aboola; nawe noba owanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nikhwosia namatsi; toto, ndakhwosilia elala amabangako akali khwiwe, nikhubakhakhwo amafura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndakhufwala tsingubo tsiamakha, nira mubilenjebio ebilaario biamaseelo amanyushe, nikhufuubila ikitani indorotoro, nikhufwimba etsieilaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikhusiaha ebimili, nira emikasa khumakhonoko, nomunyolo mwikosi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nira ingaka mumooloko, netsingaka etsiokhubirwi, nolusimbi olung'oonefu khumurwekwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nilwo olwa wasiahwa ebieitsahaabu neifeetsa; ebiifwalobio nabio biali ebieikitani indorotoro neilaasi netsiamakha; nokhulia waliitsanga obusie obunyushe nobuushi namafura. Wali owelikondo muno, nokaasila olukhaye Iwomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata wafuma mumahanga khulwa likondolio; shichila liali habwene, khulwa ing'oono eya ndakhurakhwo, Omwami NYASAYE aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa weesiika likondolio, nokhola akobutamba khulwa ifumayo, nosundula busundula obuheyibwo khubuli mubiri yesi, nibuba khuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabukula ebiokhubiifwalobio, niwikasilia habundu aheechingu, ahasiahwa amakondokondo, nokholelaho akobutamba; akafwana kario shikakholekha, kata shikalikholekha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabukula nende ebimilibio ebing'oonefu ebieitsahaabu yanje neifeetsa yanje, ebia ndali nikhuheele, nobikhola ebifwarani biabasaatsa, nokhola ninabio akobutamba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nobukula nende ebiifwalo biamakha nobifwimba, norenjekha amafura kanje namalesi kanje kelibuuliesi imbeli wabio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomukaate kwanje kwosi okwa ndakhuheelesia, okwobusie obunyushe namafura nobuushi, ebia ndakhuheelesinjia okhulia, wakureetsanga imbeli wabio khulwa eshiuya eshilayi; nikuba kurio; Omwami NYASAYE aboola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi wabukula abaanabo abasiani nabakhaana aba wanzibulila, nobeera babe omusango khubio, okhuliibwa. Obutambabwo bwosi bwali butswa likhuwa lituutu, noho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu nomala niwira abaana banje nobahaana mumulilo khubio? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mubisinyobio biosi nobutambabwo bwosi shiwayeetsulila tsindaalo tsiobwanabwo, olwa wali omukhaya, eshihechenye, nokalakalanga mumabangako, ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olunyuma Iwobubiibwo obwo bwosi (Woowe, woowe khwiwe! Omwami NYASAYE aboola) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamala wumbashe inzu irambi, niwikholela habundu aheechingu khubuli injila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayumbakha habunduwo aheechingu khubuchaachilo bwabuli injila, nokwisia likondolio eshisinyo, niwiyikulila buli mubiri yesi, niwinjiyia obutambabwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi waheyanga nende abaMisiri abamenyanibo abokhwilaasia, niwinjiyia obutambabwo, okhusinyisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, lola, enyiilile omukhono kwanje ikuluwo, nindiitiyia omukabokwo, nikhuhaana khukhwenya khwa abo abakhukiya, mbu abakhaana babaFilisiti, abafwimbwa omurwe khulwa obwilaasibwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi wakhola akobutamba nabaAshuru, shichila shiwanyalikhanga ta; toto, wakhola akobutamba ninabo, nebutswa shiwanyalikha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi wayeenjiyia obutambabwo mushialo shiobukhala, mbu ebuKalidayo; nebutswa shiwanyalikha orio ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwoyokwo nomuteshele muno, Omwami NYASAYE aboola, olwa okholanga ako kosi, ebikhole biomutamba oweinjinia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niwumbakha inzuyo irambi khubuchaachilo bwabuli muhanda, nokasia habunduwo aheechingu khubuli injila. Nebutswa shiwali shinga omutamba ta, shichila walekanga emirungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi omuheyi, owinjisia abacheni mushilenje shiomusaatsawe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu baheelesinjia abataunba bosi ebihaanwa; nebutswa iwe waheelesia abatiabo bosi ebihaanwabio, nobarunga eshiomufuusi mbu bakhwitsile okhurula tsimbeka tsiosi, khulwa obutambabwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayahukhaniile elala nabakhasi bandi mubutambabwo, shichila babulaho abakhulonda okhuheya ninawe; khandi shichila orunganga omurungo, oburarungwa ta; akoko nakabwe kahukhaniile elala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, iwe omutamba, hulila likhuwa liOMWAMI; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Okhuba wabisula obwilaasibwo nofuunula eshihechenyeshio mukhuheya nabatiabo; khandi khulwa emindu echiinamilungwa echiebisinyobio, khandi khulwa amabanga kabaanabo aba wachiheelesia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niko akachila, lola, ndalakhung'aasia halala abatiabo bosi aba wakholanga ninabo emienya chieenywe, nende abo bosi aba waheelanga, haiala nende abo bosi baba wakiyanga; ndalabakhung'aasia okhukhufukula tsimbeka tsiosi, mana ndalafuunula eshihechenyeshio imbeli wabwe, mbu bosi balole eshihechenyeshio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndalakhuyaasia, shinga abakhasi aboonoonia obuteeshani nabaraatsia amatsayi olwa bayaasibungwa; ndalakhuhaana khube imbalikha nobululu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalakhuhaana mumakhono kabwe, nabo balakwisia inzuyo irambi nibalikulula habunduwo aheechingu, niba-khunaabula tsingubotsio nebimilibio ebilayi, nibakhulekha noli omukhaya, eshihechenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi balatikulusia omukanda okhukhufukula, nibakhulasa namachina, nibakhufumira netsinganga tsiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balasamba tsinzutsio nibakhukholela akobuyaasii abakhasi abanji nibalolane ndalaakamia obutambabwo, kata shiolarunga omurungo khandi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa ndalahutsulusilia obululu bwanje khwiwe, nayo imbalikha yanje yilakhurulakhwo, niholeela, oburaba noburima khandi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila shiwayeetsulila tsindaalo tsiolwanalwo ta, nebutswa niusinyisia mumakhuwa ako kosi, niko akachila, lola, ndalaleera obukuumwi bweinjilayo khumurwekwo, Omwami NYASAYE aboola. Khubisinyobio biosi, shiomeetilekhwo okhukhola akobwilaasii?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, buli mundu owikhoonyela tsinjelo aleekhoonyela oluchelo luno khwiwe, mbu Weeyama yalia kwanyina ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe oli omukhaana wamawo, owa omusaatsawe nabaanabe bamusinya; khandi oli omukhaana wabwe abakhaana beenywe, aba abasaatsa babwe nabaana babwe babasinya; mawo yali omuHiti, naye so yali omuAmori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhaana weenywe omukhulundu niye Samaria, oyo owamenya elubeka Iwenotsi halala nabaanabe abakhaana; naye omukhaana weenywe omushe, owamenyanga esautsi, niye Sodomu, halala nabaanabe abakhaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shiwachenda butswa munjila tsiabwe, kata okhukhola akebisinyo biabwe, ta; nebutswa olunyuma Iweshise eshitiiti wabashila obubii munjilatsio tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie uno! Omwami NYASAYE aboola, omukhaana weenywe Sodomu nabakhaanabe shibakholile shinga iwe olwa okholile, halala nabakhaanabo, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, kano niko akali obumayaanu bwomukhaana weenywe Sodomu; mbu ye nabakhaanabe bali nobwikhulumamii, nokhwikura khwebiliibwa, noburabaale; kata shibakhoonya ababisandu abatakha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bali abeisunga, nibakhola eshisinyo imbeli wanje; niko akachila nimbarusiaho, olwa ndakalola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kata Samaria shiyakhola inusu yebionoono bibio ta; habula iwe wayeenjiyia ebisinyobio okhushila bo, nochila abakhaana beenywe nibalolekha shinga abalunjishi, khulwa ebisinyobio ebia wakhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe, wituushe tsisonitsio omwene, okhuba wikholile omukayili wabakhaana beenywe; khulwa ebionoonobio ebia wakholilenje, ebiali biebisinyo okhushila biabwe, bo bakhushila obulunjishi. Kho wesi okhoyile okhufwimbwa omurwe nokhwituukha tsisonitsio, shichila niwe ouchilile abakhaana beenywe nibalolekha shinga abalunjishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndalakalusia tsikhabi tsiabwe, mbu tsikhabi tsiaSodomu nabakhaanabe, netsikhabi tsiaSamaria nabakhaanabe, netsikhabi tsitsio hakari wabwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu wituushe tsisonitsio nofwimbwa omurwe khulwa kosi aka wakhola, nobalemia omwoyo orio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata abakhaana beenywe Sodomu nabakhaanabe balakalushila liba liabwe eliambeli, nabo Samaria nabakhaanabe balakalushila liba liabwe eliambeli, nawe omwene nabakhaanabo mulakalushila liba lieenywe eliambeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiwarumbulanga omukhaana weenywe Sodomu nomunwakwo mundaalo tsiobwikhulumamiibwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obubiibwo olwa bwali niburashiafuunulwa ta? Shinga iwe olwa okwile linyeko khubakhaana baEdomu nende abamubotokhana bosi, nende khubakhaana babaFilisiti, abakhuchayanga tsimbeka tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukuumwi bwobwilaasiibwo nebisinyobio buli khwiwe, OMWAMI aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
