          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola, mbu Ndalakhukholela shinga iwe olwa wakhola, iwe owaleka eshiitsubo niwoonoonia indakano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa ndaleetsulila indakano eya ndalakana ninawe mundaalo tsiolwanalwo, ne ndalakhuralisilia indakano eyirahwaho ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana oleetsulila tsinjilatsio, nofwimbwa omurwe, olwa ndalabukula abakhaana beenywe, mbu omukhulundu nende omushe, nimbakhuheelesia babe abaanabo; ne shikhulaba khulwa indakanoyo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndalaralisia indakano yanje ninawe; mana olamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu mana witsulilenje, nofwimbwa omurwe, norachinga omunwakwo khandi ta khulwa tsisonitsio; olwa ndalaba nikhulesheele kosi aka wakhola Omwami NYASAYE aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.63",
